<title>USA: Great Western Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Great Western Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.44		    $0.47</p>
<p> Net			 65,703		   71,294</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 141,596		  139,143</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Great Western Financial Corp.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 oper net was $89.1 million, or $0.61 per share, excluding $33.7 million in merger-related costs.</p>
<p>First Call estimate for 1997 Q1 was $0.62 per share.</p>
</text>
